//- views/panels/_weapons_panel.pug
//- Weapons & Attacks repeating section. Profiles from the game's melee and
//- ranged weapon tables, declared here at compile time and embedded as the
//- auto-fill table. The Name options below are written out individually
//- (looping them through a k-scaffold mixin breaks the option text) and must
//- match these keys. Axe and Javelin have melee and thrown profiles with a
//- suffix each. Field keys match the row's attribute names.
